<% content_for :title, "Boredom & Restlessness Relapse Plan | Bipolar Sober" %>

<main class="relapse-plan-page">

  <section class="relapse-plan-hero">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <%= link_to "← ALL RELAPSE PLANS", toolbox_relapse_plans_path,
          class: "relapse-plan-back" %>

      <p class="relapse-plan-eyebrow">
        BIPOLAR SOBER / RELAPSE PLANS / BOREDOM &amp; RESTLESSNESS
      </p>

      <h1>
        <span>BORED OUT</span>
        <span>OF YOUR</span>
        <span>FUCKING SKULL?</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="relapse-plan-intro">
        MY SOBRIETY PLAN FOR EMPTY HOURS &amp; RESTLESS ENERGY.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-pink">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">01 / THE EMPTY SPACE</p>
      <h2>WHAT AM I<br>LOOKING FOR?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write about boredom, restlessness, and what drinking used to fill.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-black">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">02 / MY PATTERNS</p>
      <h2>WHEN DOES<br>IT HIT?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY VULNERABLE HOURS</h3>
          <p>[Write the times and situations you want a plan for.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHAT I ACTUALLY WANT</h3>
          <p>[Write what is missing in those moments.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-yellow">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">03 / MY ACTUAL OPTIONS</p>
      <h2>SOMETHING<br>I’LL REALLY DO.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>FIVE MINUTES</h3>
          <p>[Add realistic options for a short stretch of time.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>A WHOLE EVENING</h3>
          <p>[Add options for longer empty stretches.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>LOW ENERGY OR PAIN DAY</h3>
          <p>[Add options that fit your physical capacity.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>SOMETHING WITH SOMEONE</h3>
          <p>[Add people and activities you can realistically arrange.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-purple">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">04 / WHEN IT BECOMES A DRINKING URGE</p>
      <h2>MY NEXT<br>TEN MINUTES.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write your immediate plan, contact person, and backup support.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>